  "label": "Charitable Giving",
  "description": "The concept of charitable giving refers to the voluntary transfer of resources (money, goods, time) to support causes or individuals in need. In this meme, the appeal for 'ten cents a day' to feed children is a direct call to action rooted in charitable giving, which is a real-world social and economic phenomenon. It relies on the understanding that individuals can contribute financially to humanitarian efforts.",
